  "gloss": "Evaluates execution feasibility of a plan",
  "mechanism": "Acts as a Judge#f7d5 to evaluate the Value#3c5d and feasibility of a Plan#18a7. Classifies the execution path into three qualitative states: (1) Magical: Relies on undefined Step#5f22s or unavailable physics. (2) Uncertain: The dependency chain is clear, but specific links are unverified. (3) Coherent: Every Step#5f22 maps to a known primitive or realizable sub-component.",
  "signature": [
